   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,580:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Osservazioni:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,580:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,581:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Il Kappa è straordinariamente stabile
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,583:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  lungo tutte le soglie (range: 0.9688–0.9706). Questo significa
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,583:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: che il modello VMGP mantiene una performance 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,584:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: chance-adjusted
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,585:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  quasi identica indipendentemente
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,586:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: dal numero di razze incluse.
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,586:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,586:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: L
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,587:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,587:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Accuracy raw cresce con meno razze
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,592:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (0.9709 → 0.9729 da 30 a 70 campioni), ma questo è un
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,593:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: artefatto: classificare 10 classi è intrinsecamente più facile che classificarne 34. Il Kappa corregge per
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,593:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: questo.
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,593:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,594:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: La soglia 40 ha il miglior Kappa medio
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,594:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (0.9706), ma la differenza con 30 (0.9691) è minima.
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,595:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  4 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,595:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Il Silhouette decresce
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,595:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  al crescere dei campioni: con 30 campioni le 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,596:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,596:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: isole
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,596:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,601:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  sono più nette (0.7237),
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,604:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: con 70 si sovrappongono leggermente di più (0.7068). Probabile effetto del ridotto numero di razze
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,604:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: su come i cluster occupano lo spazio.
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,605:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Conclusione:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,605:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  La soglia 
