   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,698:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: La griglia attuale include 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,699:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 34 razze
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,699:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (vs 26) per la soglia 30, un task
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,700:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: significativamente più difficile
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,700:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,701:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Il capping dei campioni a 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,701:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: min_samples
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,702:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (e non a un fisso) cambia la
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,702:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: composizione del training set
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,703:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,703:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: La metrica chiave ora è Cohen
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,704:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,704:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s Kappa, che fornisce un confronto più equo
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,705:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 9. Guida alla Lettura dei Grafici
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,705:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: A. Heatmap Griglia Esperimenti (
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,706:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: grid_experiment_heatmaps.png
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,706:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,706:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,707:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Righe:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,707:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Min Samples per Breed (30→70)
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,708:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,708:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Colonne:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,709:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Latent Dimension (32→128)
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,709:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,709:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Colore:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,710:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Verde = buono, Rosso = scarso
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,710:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,711:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Interpretazione:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,712:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  4 heatmap separate per Accuracy, Kappa, Silhouette e GE. Cercare le celle più
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,713:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: verdi per la configurazione ottimale.
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,713:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: B. Trade-off Analysis (
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,714:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: tradeoff_analysis.png
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,714:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,715:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,715:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Pannello 1 (alto sx):
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,716:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Barre con il numero di razze incluse per ogni soglia — mostra il costo in diversità.
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,716:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,717:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Pannello 2 (alto dx):
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,717:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Accuracy raw per soglia — attenzione, non direttamente comparabile
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,718:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: !
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,718:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,719:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Pannello 3 (basso sx):
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,719:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Cohen
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,719:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,720:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s Kappa per soglia — il confronto equo.
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,720:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
