   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,723:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: trend_per_latent_dim.png
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,723:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,723:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,724:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 4 grafici
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,724:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (Kappa, Accuracy, GE, Silhouette) con una linea per ogni Latent Dim.
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,725:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,725:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Asse X:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,726:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Min Samples per Breed
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,726:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,727:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Linee sovrapposte:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,727:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Indicano che la Latent Dim ha poco impatto → si può comprimere di più.
