   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,732:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: samples, con 4 subplot (1 per latent
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,732:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: _
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,733:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: dim)
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,733:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,733:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Normalizzate per riga:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,734:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  ogni cella mostra la recall per classe
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,734:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
