   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,737:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 10. Conclusioni e Raccomandazioni
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,737:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Risultati chiave:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,737:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,738:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Il modello VMGP è estremamente robusto
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,740:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  agli iperparametri testati: tutte le 20 combinazioni
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,740:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: raggiungono Kappa > 0.966 e Accuracy > 0.968.
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,740:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,741:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Cohen
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,741:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,741:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s Kappa è stabile
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,742:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (0.9667–0.9714) nonostante il numero di razze vari da 10 a 34 — il modello
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,743:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: scala bene.
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,743:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,743:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: La dimensione latente ha impatto trascurabile
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,744:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  sulla classificazione: 32 dimensioni sono
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,745:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: sufficienti (compressione ~1,550×).
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,745:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  4 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,746:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: La Silhouette favorisce dimensioni basse
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,746:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (32) e pochi campioni (30) — cluster più netti.
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,746:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  5 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,747:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: SMOTE non è stato testato
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,748:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  in questa griglia, ma i risultati precedenti suggerivano che non era
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,748:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: necessario con ≥40 campioni.
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,749:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Raccomandazioni:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,749:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,750:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Per massima diversità (raccomandato):
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,750:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,750:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Samples_30_LatDim_96
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,751:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  → 34 razze, Kappa=0.9714
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,751:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,751:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Per massima stabilità:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,752:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,752:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Samples_40_LatDim_32
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,753:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  → 26 razze, Kappa=0.9710, Silhouette=0.7388
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,753:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,753:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Per massima compressione:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,754:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,754:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Samples_70_LatDim_32
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,755:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  → 10 razze, Kappa=0.9703, MSE=0.3939
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,755:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: (più basso)
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,755:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,756:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Per deployment:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,757:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Latent Dim = 32 è sufficiente per qualsiasi soglia — riduce costi computazionali e
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,757:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: storage
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,757:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Prossimi passi suggeriti:
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,758:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,758:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Testare le migliori configurazioni su un test set hold-out separato
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,759:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,759:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Valutare l
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,759:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,760:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: aggiunta di task secondari (continente, caseina) con le configurazioni ottimali
   DEBUG: 2026-02-23 23:42:24,760:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
